```wireframe
board "Coffee shop" accent=green
  screen phone "Checkout"
    navbar "Checkout" leading=back
    card title="Order summary"
      list
        listitem title="Latte" trailing=text trailingText="$4.50"
        listitem title="Croissant" trailing=text trailingText="$3.25"
      divider
      stack row justify=between
        text bold "Total"
        text bold "$7.75"
    select "Payment method" placeholder="Select card"
    toggle "Save card" on
    button primary "Pay" fullWidth
```
